### Scenario 3 - heavy article: flat 29.00 EUR surcharge for everybody (GOLD included)
### HOM-4004 (45 kg) for customer 2 (SILVER): 480.00 - 5% = 456.00 HT, 547.20 TTC
### Standard shipping is free (>= 50 EUR), the surcharge remains: shippingTtc = 29.00, totalTtc = 576.20

@order = http://localhost:8083

### 1. Cart
# @name cart
POST {{order}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 2 }

###
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "HOM-4004", "qty": 1 }

### 2. Checkout
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shippingMethod": "STANDARD" }

### Same cart content for GOLD customer 1: standard shipping is free but the surcharge still applies
# @name cartGold
POST {{order}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1 }

###
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cartGold.response.body.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "HOM-4004", "qty": 1 }

###
POST {{order}}/carts/{{cartGold.response.body.id}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shippingMethod": "STANDARD" }
